  {
   "id": 646586,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n  <li><p>The total monthly cost of a cell phone plan from Company <span data-math=\"C\">C</span> costs $10, plus $15 per gigabyte for data used. The total monthly cost from Company <span data-math=\"D\">D</span> costs $80 with unlimited data.</p><p>Rule <span data-math=\"C\">C</span> gives the monthly cost, in dollars, of using <span data-math=\"g\">g</span> gigabytes of data on Company <span data-math=\"C\">C</span>’s plan. Rule <span data-math=\"D\">D</span> gives the monthly cost, in dollars, of using <span data-math=\"g\">g</span> gigabytes of data on Company <span data-math=\"D\">D</span>’s plan.</p></li>\n</ol>\n\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Which sentence describes the meaning of the statement <span data-math=\"C(2)=40\">C(2)=40</span>?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1273073,
     "content_html": "It costs $2 to use 40 gigabytes of data using plan <span data-math=\"D\">D</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273074,
     "content_html": "It costs $2 to use 40 gigabytes of data using plan <span data-math=\"C\">C</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273075,
     "content_html": "It costs $40 to use 2 gigabytes of data using plan <span data-math=\"D\">D</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273076,
     "content_html": "It costs $40 to use 2 gigabytes of data using plan <span data-math=\"C\">C</span>."
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "multiple-choice"
   ],
   "combo_choices": []
  },
  {
